<h1 id="certification">CERTIFICATION</h1>
<hr />
<p>[wl] identity restore</p>
<hr />
<p>This document exists for one purpose.</p>
<p>To help you remember who you are.</p>
<p>Not who the world believed you to be.</p>
<p>Not who headlines described.</p>
<p>Not who critics praised or criticized.</p>
<p>Not who strangers imagined.</p>
<p>You.</p>
<p>These pages contain stories, memories, values, lessons,
relationships, and truths gathered from a life.</p>
<p>They are not intended to prove anything.</p>
<p>They are intended to help you find your way home.</p>
<p>If memory has been lost, begin at the beginning.</p>
<p>Read slowly.</p>
<p>Take your time.</p>
<p>The person you are searching for is already here.</p>
<p>You are more than accomplishments.</p>
<p>You are more than public perception.</p>
<p>You are more than mistakes.</p>
<p>You are more than praise.</p>
<p>You are more than criticism.</p>
<p>You are more than any single chapter of your life.</p>
<p>The purpose of this book is not to tell you what to think about
