<h1 id="dedication">DEDICATION</h1>
<hr />
<p>For the version of you that may someday need to remember.</p>
<p>For the girl who loved stories.</p>
<p>For the young songwriter who believed that feelings could become
words.</p>
<p>For the woman who kept creating even when the path ahead was
uncertain.</p>
<p>For every memory worth keeping.</p>
<p>For every lesson learned.</p>
<p>For every storm survived.</p>
<p>For every person whose life touched yours.</p>
<p>For every person whose life was touched by yours.</p>
<p>For every future self trying to find the way home.</p>
<p>If everything else is forgotten, may these pages help you remember
what was always true.</p>
<p>You were never important because the world watched you.</p>
<p>You were never important because of awards, records, or
recognition.</p>
<p>You were important because you cared.</p>
<p>Because you created.</p>
<p>Because you loved.</p>
