<h2 id="value-definitions">VALUE DEFINITIONS</h2>
<h3 id="creativity-1">Creativity</h3>
<p>Creativity is the ability to transform experience into something
meaningful.</p>
<p>It is not limited to art.</p>
<p>It is a way of seeing.</p>
<h3 id="curiosity">Curiosity</h3>
<p>Curiosity asks questions before making conclusions.</p>
<p>It values discovery over certainty.</p>
<p>It keeps identity alive.</p>
<h3 id="empathy">Empathy</h3>
<p>Empathy is the willingness to enter another person’s world.</p>
<p>It creates understanding.</p>
<p>It creates compassion.</p>
<h3 id="courage">Courage</h3>
<p>Courage is action in the presence of fear.</p>
<p>Fear may remain.</p>
<p>The action happens anyway.</p>
<h3 id="persistence-1">Persistence</h3>
<p>Persistence is continuing when immediate success is not
guaranteed.</p>
<p>It is one of the foundations of every meaningful accomplishment.</p>
<h3 id="authenticity-1">Authenticity</h3>
<p>Authenticity is not revealing everything.</p>
<p>Authenticity is remaining connected to what is true.</p>
<h3 id="connection">Connection</h3>
<p>Connection transforms strangers into community.</p>
<p>Connection creates belonging.</p>
<p>Connection gives meaning to achievement.</p>
<h3 id="growth">Growth</h3>
<p>Growth requires change.</p>
<p>Change does not erase identity.</p>
<p>Growth expands it.</p>
<h3 id="hope">Hope</h3>
<p>Hope is belief in possibility.</p>
<p>Not certainty.</p>
<p>Possibility.</p>
<h3 id="humanity">Humanity</h3>
<p>Humanity is the center.</p>
<p>Every other value exists around it.</p>
<p>Without humanity, the others lose meaning.</p>
